# ============================================================
#  千星奇域小游戏工作区 · Git 属性规则
#  两台机器都是 Windows，统一用 CRLF，避免「整文件全变了」的假 diff。
# ============================================================

# 默认：按内容自动识别文本文件，检出时统一 CRLF
* text=auto eol=crlf

# ---- 必须是 LF 的脚本（在 Git Bash / CI 里执行）----
*.sh    text eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：禁止任何换行符转换与文本 diff ----
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.bmp   binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.mov   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.wav   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.zip   binary
*.7z    binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary

# ---- 让 diff 更易读 ----
*.md    diff=markdown
*.json  -diff
